### C++ Standard

- **Minimum:** C++17
- **Recommended:** C++20 (if all platforms support)
- **Required features:** `std::atomic`, structured bindings, `constexpr`

## What Should NEVER Be Done

### Anti-Patterns

1. **Never allocate on audio thread**
   ```cpp
   // ❌ WRONG
   void processBlock(...) {
       buffer.setSize(512); // Allocation!
   }

   // ✅ CORRECT
   void prepareToPlay(...) {
       buffer.setSize(512); // Pre-allocate
   }
   ```

2. **Never use mutex on audio thread**
   ```cpp
   // ❌ WRONG
   std::mutex mtx;
   void processBlock(...) {
       mtx.lock(); // May block!
   }

   // ✅ CORRECT
   std::atomic<float> param;
   void processBlock(...) {
       float value = param.load(std::memory_order_acquire);
   }
   ```

3. **Never store static mutable state**
   ```cpp
   // ❌ WRONG
   static int lastPreset; // Shared across instances!

   // ✅ CORRECT
   int lastPreset; // Per-instance member
   ```

4. **Never skip parameter smoothing**
   ```cpp
   // ❌ WRONG
   float cutoff = *cutoffParam; // Clicks on automation!

   // ✅ CORRECT
   float cutoff = smoothedCutoff.getNextValue(); // Smooth
   ```

5. **Never use Projucer for version control**
   - CMake is text-based and diff-friendly
   - Projucer generates binary project files

## Safe Modification Methods

| Operation | Location | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Add parameter | AudioProcessorEditor | Use APVTS parameter layout |
| Modify DSP | DSP module | Add prepare/reset/process methods |
| Change GUI | Editor class | JUCE Component hierarchy |
| Add test | tests/ directory | Catch2 TEST_CASE macro |
| Update JUCE | CMakeLists.txt | Change GIT_TAG version |

## Deployment Procedure

### Development Build

```bash
cmake -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug
cmake --build build
# Plugin automatically copied to ~/.vst3/
```

### Release Build

```bash
cmake -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
cmake --build build
cmake --install build --prefix ./dist
# Creates ./dist/bin/MyPlugin.vst3
```

### Distribution Package

```bash
cd dist
zip -r MyPlugin-linux-v1.0.0.zip bin/MyPlugin.vst3
```

